  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 85 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D4"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA posted the oxytocin shortage on 2022-09-23 and it has remained on the list for 49 months as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A registered plant on our product labels, Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC (FEI 1450022), received an OAI classification after an inspection that ended 2022-06-30, 85 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E14", "D4", "E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same plant had an earlier OAI inspection ending 2020-05-18, 858 days before the posting, with observations on sterile procedures and batch records.",
      "cites": ["E11", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A second registered plant for the same labeler (FEI 3001833549) also has a history of OAI inspections, including one ending 2011-07-08 and another ending 2013-01-11.",
      "cites": ["E28", "E17", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both plants received VAI classifications in 2023, after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E13", "E26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "P&T has approved an interchange to an alternate concentration from Par Health USA, LLC (NDC 42023011602) as of 2026-04-16.",
      "cites": ["E29"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-selected purchase option is Cardinal Health 107, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    }
  ]
}
